{"version":1,"key":"quest:23","content":{"id":23,"title":"域名解析时是 TCP 还是 UDP？","summary":"域名解析通常使用 UDP 协议，因为 UDP 协议具有较低的延迟和较少的开销，非常适合于快速查询。但是在有的时候，当响应大于 512 字节时，或需要可靠传输时，会使用 TCP 协议。","target":{"key":"quest:23","type":"quest","id":23},"groupId":6,"groupTitle":"网络","groupColor":"grape-purple","status":"resolved","answers":[{"id":1399,"createTime":1744723113335,"updateTime":1744723113335,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"域名解析通常使用 UDP 协议，因为 UDP 协议具有较低的延迟和较少的开销，非常适合于快速查询。但是在有的时候，当响应大于 512 字节时，或需要可靠传输时，会使用 TCP 协议。"}],"disableDrag":false}],"source":{"type":"custom","contentId":1399,"published":false}}],"materials":[],"trail":[{"time":1744701398005,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1744723113335,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下解答","refs":[]},{"time":1744723113335,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"createTime":1744701398005,"updateTime":1744723113335,"resolvedTime":1744723113335},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1744723113335}}